    "title": "What the People Say: Do Residents Support Federal Takeover of DC Police?",
    "text": "Just a little more than a week into the federal takeover of D.C. police, the Trump administration unveils data showing a large number of arrests happening in high-crime neighborhoods. What do residents in those areas make of the crackdown? NTD's Sam Wang was out in D.C.'s Anacostia neighborhood to hear from the people.\nWhat the People Say: Do Residents Support Federal Takeover of DC Police?\nJust a little more than a week into the federal takeover of D.C. police, the Trump administration unveils data showing a large number of arrests happening in high-crime neighborhoods.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 8/20/2025, 11:50:24 PM EDT",
